      "title": "Calculation",
      "description": "The specified and unspecified degradation products are calculated against CP-4 in the reference solution with the corresponding Response correction factor (RF). IWP =  integration value of the by-product or degradation product in the test solution IWR =  integration value of the by-product or degradation product in the reference solution PR =   initial concentration of the reference substance [mg/mL] PP =   initial concentration of the substance [mg/mL] C =     content of the reference substance, in %"
